# Oh-my-cut：只追蹤文字檔（cut.json、edits.jsonl、outline.md、STATE.md、style.md…）
# 影片、音訊、縮圖、字體一律不進 git。

# ---- 素材資料夾（整個不追蹤）----
video_editor/*/raw_footage/
video_editor/*/references/
video_editor/*/exports/
taste/*/videos/
brand/music/

# ---- work/ 只排除產生出來的媒體，文字檔照常追蹤 ----
video_editor/*/work/proxies/
*.preview.mp4
*.sheet.jpg
sheet_*.jpg

# ---- 影片 ----
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
*.mkv
*.avi
*.webm
*.mts
*.m2ts
*.mxf
*.insv
*.lrv
*.thm
*.braw
*.r3d

# ---- 音訊 ----
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.aif
*.aiff
*.flac
*.ogg
*.opus
*.caf

# ---- 圖片 ----
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.gif
*.webp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.bmp
*.psd
*.dng
*.arw
*.cr2
*.cr3
*.nef
*.raf

# ---- 字體（二進位、可能有授權限制）----
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2

# ---- Final Cut ----
*.fcpbundle/

# ---- 疊加層引擎（overlay/ 的原始碼追蹤，依賴與輸出不追蹤）----
node_modules/
overlay/out/
overlay/renders/

# ---- 本機環境 ----
# env.json、smoke.json 是本機的；overlay_engine 是全專案的引擎選擇，要追蹤
.omc/*
!.omc/overlay_engine
.claude/settings.local.json

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# ---- macOS ----
.DS_Store
._*
